# Tienda de Isla Ceniza (C7, contract 53, Mart): the shopkeeper behind the counter, the shop opens at once: `shop isla_ceniza`. Same layout as the Ambar tienda.
@map tienda_ceniza
@size 9 7
@interior yes
@bg 3
@fill floor_wood
@spawn door 4 5 N
@legend
  .  tile=floor_wood
  a  tile=none object=wall_j
  b  tile=none object=wall_i
  c  tile=floor_wood object=shelf
  d  tile=floor_wood object=counter
  e  tile=none object=wall_win_j
  f  tile=mat
  g  tile=none object=wall_corner
  h  tile=floor_wood face=SW id=clerk npc=tendero script=clerk
@grid
  gaeaaaeaa
  b.ccc.cc.
  b...h....
  b.ddd....
  b.......c
  b........
  b...ff...
@warp f -> isla_ceniza spawn=tienda_door
@script clerk npc
    shop isla_ceniza
@end
